senses.gloss:
शंस् शं॑सति (शं॑स˚ते), pp. शस्त॑ (q.v.) &
शंशित say in a loud and solemn voice, recite, praise, vow, unfold,
betray, announce, communicate, declare, foretell, prophesy. C.
शंसयति cause to recite;
 announce, foretell. — अति recite beyond
(2 acc. or instr. & acc.);
 omit in reciting. अनु recite or praise
(after another). अभि accuse, defame;
 praise, commend. आ M. (A.)
hope or trust in, strive after (loc., acc., dat., or infin.), try to
master (acc.), suppose, expect, fear;
 wish, desire (acc. or — & —
infin.). beg for (acc.);
 praise, commend, recite, announce, foretell.
समा A. adjudge to (dat.);
 M. hope or trust in (acc.). उद् call upon,
invoke. प्र tell forth, proclaim aloud;
 stir up, excite;
 praise,
extol, recommend to (gen.). वि recite, divide^1 in reciting. सम्
recite (together). उपसम् recite in addition. — Cf. अभिशस्त,
प्रशस्त॑.
[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.

